
1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Are we still on for Saturday?

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,500
Absolutely. I've been looking forward to it.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,500
Great. I found a small café by the river.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,500
Sounds good. What time should we meet?

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,500
How about ten in the morning?

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,500
That's a bit early for me.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,500
Fair enough. Let's make it eleven.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,500
That works for me.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,500
By the way, can I bring a friend?

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Of course. The more, the merrier.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,500
She just moved here last week.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,500
Then we should show her around.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,500
Good idea. There's a nice park nearby.

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,500
We could go for a walk after coffee.

15
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,500
As long as it doesn't rain.

16
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,500
The forecast looks promising.

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,500
I'll believe it when I see it.

18
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,500
You're probably right.

19
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,500
Do you know how to get there?

20
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,500
Not exactly. Could you send me the address?

21
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,500
Sure, I'll text it to you tonight.

22
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,500
Thanks. I owe you one.

23
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,500
No worries. See you on Saturday.

24
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,500
See you then. Don't be late!
